# (Bot2's hand 5 -> 6) and draws Bot1 a card (hand 5 -> 6).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Black Lotus
Whoosh!
Island x4
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Mox Ruby
Lightning Bolt
Island x4
Island x10

